Launcher3 of Android 14 QPR1 (android-14.0.0_r17, GSI UQ1A) — two taskbar NPEs, 1–2 launcher3 crashes per boot of
the aosp14-gsi slot (12.10.2026):
1. updateButtonLayoutSpacing() runs from onConfigurationChanged() and touches mBackButton, which initButtons() creates
   only when the taskbar is built in 3-button navigation or during setup; when the mode turns 3-button later the field
   is still null.
2. updateNavButtonInAppDisplayProgressForSysui() and updateNavButtonTranslationY() run after onDestroy() cleared
   mControllers (as a17/0024): onDestroy() itself calls setUIController() → onUiControllerChanged() → both.
Applied to the GSI slot as bytecode (bin/build-gsi-slot.sh, NullFieldReturnPatch; the first with "all" — mBackButton is
read in several branches).

